    "body": "Chat04.1 integration gate rechecked 2026-10-29 (READ-ONLY repo audit; no implementation attempted): status `UI_ONLY_PASS (isolated preview) / BLOCKED_SCOPE_COLLISION / BLOCKED_RUNTIME`. `main@31b7a077820914e92de81239e5ab4099e3dfa558`, PR #453 HEAD `e55eaedb8421658195ab1322b71bbcee9345f07d` remains Draft/unmerged. PR #431 remains OPEN/DRAFT, `mergeable=false`, based on stale main `183d522e…`, and owns shared source/deployed `ui-core.js` and `style-base.css` mirrors. In-game Chat04.1 requires serialized ownership of those shared files plus `ui-chat.js` and both mirrors, with index/boot wiring determined only after a new review. Do not rebase/merge/change #431 under Chat04.1; do not use the dirty unrelated Stage7.15 checkout. Next 04.1 action after #431 ownership is resolved: re-audit exact main/PR heads, authorize a separate integration atom, execute cross-view and Safari/desktop regressions. Messaging identity/session/backend/authz/durable history remain separate runtime blockers. 04.5 completion reminder remains gated by actual Chat04.1 runtime, Chat04.4 and Chat05A–C runtime PASS.",
