    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "## Summary / scope\n- Isolated Chat04.1 public timeline **UI preview**, not integrated into the application.\n- Text and compact system entries, explicit unavailable/demo modes, chronological fixtures, 8-item older-page pagination and scroll anchoring, loading/error/empty states, disabled composer.\n- The fixture messages are synthetic, labelled TEST DATA. No send, delivery, or durable storage is claimed.\n- Changes restricted to four files under `tools/`; game mechanics Chat03, app boot/renderer, `Web/docs` mirrors and other stages are untouched.\n\n## Verification on HEAD `e55eaedb8421658195ab1322b71bbcee9345f07d`\n- Reconstructed all four files from their exact GitHub blob content and verified local `git hash-object` matches each GitHub blob SHA.\n- `node --check` passed for JS and fixture test.\n- `node tools/test_chat04_1_general_chat.mjs`: **23/23 PASS** (`CHAT04_1_UI_FIXTURES_PASS`).\n- Headless Chromium browser render/interaction using the exact HTML, CSS and JS bytes (CSS and JS inlined into `page.set_content` because sandbox blocks direct file/localhost navigations): **4/4 viewport smoke PASS**.\n- Tested 1440x900 desktop, 393x852 mobile, 375x667 mobile, 320x568 compact mobile.\n- All viewports: visible scrollable feed, no horizontal body overflow, composer inside viewport, chronological older-page prepend, 24/24 fixtures accessible, scroll anchor deviation below 1px, no JS exceptions.\n- Before compact-mobile fix, the 320x568 feed height was 40px; after fix, 238px.\n- Chromium keyboard smoke: initial tab order, Left/Right arrows, game/public switching, empty work mode, disabled composer, demo/error toggles all passed.\n- `git diff --no-index --check` of the two latest touched files against their previous content: no whitespace violations.\n- GitHub Action `ai-forensics-evidence` run #1952: SUCCESS, but this workflow does **not** execute the Chat04.1 fixture or browser checks. Those were executed separately.\n\n## Acceptance boundary\n**UI_ONLY_PASS (standalone preview) / BLOCKED_RUNTIME**. Headless Chromium mobile viewport emulation is not a test on a physical iPhone/Safari. Full Chat04.1 runtime/in-app PASS is NOT claimed. The preview is not wired into the game, and identity/session design, authenticated messaging, permissions, delivery and durable history are not available. Keep PR Draft; integration must be authorized separately, with repo ownership and dependencies checked first.\n",
    "closed_at": null,
